    <note>
      <item><![CDATA[**Module:** JP Skills]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Version:** 2.5]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Date:** February 2025]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Status:** ✅ Fully Compatible]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[## Summary<br />The module **mod_uk_skills** has been successfully modernized to **Joomla 4/5/6 architecture** with namespaces, service providers, and custom dispatcher pattern. It is now **fully compatible** with Joomla 5 and 6, with and without backward compatibility plugins.]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[## Migration Details]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[### Before (Version 2.0)]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[### After (Version 2.5)]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[## Changes Made (Step by Step)]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[### Step 1: Security - Output Escaping]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Files:** `tmpl/default.php`]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[### Step 2: Language Files]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Files:** `languages/*`, `mod_uk_skills.xml`]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[### Step 3: Modern Architecture]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Files:** `services/provider.php`, `src/Dispatcher/Dispatcher.php`, `mod_uk_skills.xml`]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[### Step 4: Final Cleanup]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[**Files:** `tmpl/default.php`, `mod_uk_skills.php` (deleted)]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[## Architecture]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[### Service Provider<br />```<br />services/provider.php<br />```<br />Registers the module with Joomla&apos;s dependency injection container using the modern service provider pattern.]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[### Custom Dispatcher<br />```<br />src/Dispatcher/Dispatcher.php<br />Namespace: Joomlaplates\Module\UkSkills\Site\Dispatcher<br />```<br />Extends `AbstractModuleDispatcher` and prepares all data for the template in `getLayoutData()`:]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[### Template<br />```<br />tmpl/default.php<br />```<br />Receives prepared data from Dispatcher. All output is properly escaped.]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[### Custom JavaScript<br />```<br />js/mod_uk_skills.js<br />```<br />ToxProgress library for animated skill circles.]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[## Features<br />This module creates animated skill circles with:]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[### Circle Parameters (per item):]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[## Compatibility Matrix<br />| Environment | Status | Notes |<br />|-------------|--------|-------|<br />| Joomla 4.x | ✅ Works | Modern architecture |<br />| Joomla 5.x (no plugin) | ✅ Works | Fully compatible |<br />| Joomla 5.x (with plugin) | ✅ Works | Plugin not needed |<br />| Joomla 6.x (no plugin) | ✅ Works | Fully compatible |<br />| Joomla 6.x (with plugin) | ✅ Works | Plugin not needed |]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[## Security Improvements<br />| Issue | Before | After |<br />|-------|--------|-------|<br />| Content class | ❌ No escaping | ✅ htmlspecialchars() |<br />| Item style | ❌ No escaping | ✅ htmlspecialchars() |<br />| Center class | ❌ No escaping | ✅ htmlspecialchars() |<br />| Circle parameters | ❌ No validation | ✅ (int) casting |<br />| Circle colors | ❌ No escaping | ✅ htmlspecialchars() |<br />| Title output | ❌ No escaping | ✅ htmlspecialchars() |<br />| Content output | ❌ No escaping | ✅ htmlspecialchars() |]]></item>
      <item><![CDATA[## Testing Performed<br />Each step was tested individually:<br />1. ✅ **Step 1 (Escaping):** Module displayed correctly with security improvements<br />2. ✅ **Step 2 (Languages):** German/English translations working<br />3. ✅ **Step 3 (Architecture):** Modern dispatcher working properly, slider parameters correct<br />4. ✅ **Step 4 (Finalization):** Legacy entry file removed, module still works]]></item>
